  "title": "The Mixed-Tool Workshop",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "learning/study",
  "premise": "An apprentice wants to choose the right method for each puzzle, but grouped practice lets the shelf label make every choice. Mixed puzzle cards remove that cue and require a reason before selecting a tool.",
